  - ServerUpdateMsg and every ServerCommand numeric constant: retained by
    task requirement. ParseServerUpdateMsg remains live in receivesendproc.
  - RegisterMsg, PingMsg, and PongMsg: their parsers remain live in
    receivesendproc. New Gob round-trip coverage protects all three.

